{"id":"3ee467f6e73efb8680e380c024a9cd7f5746f18b","axis":"silent","repo":"envoyproxy/envoy","sha":"3ee467f6e73efb8680e380c024a9cd7f5746f18b","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"changelogs/current/new_features/dynamic_modules__bootstrap-listener-writer.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@","+Added a listener writer to the dynamic module bootstrap extension. Once a module calls","+``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_enable_listener_writer``, it can add, update","+and remove listeners with","+``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_add_or_update`` and","+``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_remove``, and","+``envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_update_done`` reports when each write","+becomes active or why it failed. The Rust SDK exposes these as ``enable_listener_writer``,","+``listener_writer_add_or_update`` and ``listener_writer_remove`` of","+``EnvoyBootstrapExtensionConfig`` and ``on_listener_writer_update_done`` of","+``BootstrapExtensionConfig``. See","+:ref:`Listener Writer <config_bootstrap_extensions_dynamic_modules_listener_writer>`."],"additions":11,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/root/configuration/other_features/bootstrap_extensions/dynamic_modules.rst","lines":["@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@ This can be used to implement:"," "," * Server initialization logic when Envoy starts."," * Code that runs on every worker thread.","-* Clusters that the module adds, updates and removes.","+* Clusters and listeners that the module adds, updates and removes."," * Singleton patterns for configuration loading from external services."," * Global state management across filters."," * Background tasks that run on the main thread.","@@ -61,8 +61,8 @@ A module calls ``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_run_on_all_wo"," main thread to run its ``envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_worker_event`` hook on every"," worker thread. Once every worker ran the event,"," ``envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_run_on_all_workers_done`` runs on the main thread. A","-worker runs the event after it applied the cluster and host changes that Envoy posted to it","-before the call, so the done hook tells the module that every worker can use them. Host health,","+worker runs the event after it applied the cluster, host and listener changes that Envoy posted to","+it before the call, so the done hook tells the module that every worker can use them. Host health,"," weight and metadata changes that a cluster merges over its :ref:`update_merge_window"," <envoy_v3_api_field_config.cluster.v3.Cluster.CommonLbConfig.update_merge_window>` can reach the"," workers later.","@@ -95,7 +95,7 @@ holds back the CDS requests while it warms, as a cluster delivered by CDS does,"," :ref:`wait_for_warm_on_init <envoy_v3_api_field_config.cluster.v3.Cluster.wait_for_warm_on_init>`"," is false. While Envoy applies a burst of writes, it holds back the EDS, LEDS and SDS requests on"," those streams, including their ACKs, for about one second, as it does while it applies a CDS","-update. A write that changes a cluster","+update. A burst of the listener writer extends this hold. A write that changes a cluster"," rebuilds it and drains its connection pools, so change endpoints through a dynamic module cluster"," instead."," ","@@ -123,6 +123,61 @@ prefix, tagged with ``config_name`` set to the extension name, or ``default`` if","   clusters_owned, Gauge, Clusters that the module owns","   updates_pending, Gauge, Writes that are queued or warming"," ","+.. _config_bootstrap_extensions_dynamic_modules_listener_writer:","+","+Listener Writer","+---------------","+","+Once the module calls ``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_enable_listener_writer``,","+it can add, update and remove listeners. It passes a serialized","+:ref:`Listener <envoy_v3_api_msg_config.listener.v3.Listener>` to","+``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_add_or_update``, and Envoy","+reports the outcome of each write through","+``envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_update_done``. A write is active once","+the listener finished warming and Envoy posted it to the workers. A State-of-the-World LDS update","+does not remove the listeners that the module writes, and the module should only write listeners","+that no other component writes.","+","+Writes that the module submits before it calls","+``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_config_signal_init_complete`` are applied before","+Envoy finishes initializing, and Envoy starts its workers once their listeners warmed, so they serve","+from the first connection. Those writes complete as active once the workers started, so a module","+must not wait for them before it signals that its initialization is complete.","+","+A written listener has the same authority as a listener delivered by LDS, so build listeners from a","+schema that the module owns. While Envoy applies a burst of writes, it holds back the RDS, SRDS,","+VHDS, FCDS and SDS requests on the ADS stream and the xDS-TP authority streams, including their","+ACKs, for about one second, as it does while it applies an LDS update. A burst of the cluster writer","+extends this hold. When a written listener fails to listen after it warmed, its write fails. If the","+write added addresses in place, the workers keep serving the previous version. Otherwise Envoy","+removes the listener and its previous version, and the module no longer owns it. The error details","+of the write say which of the two happened.","+","+The config dump lists written listeners as dynamic listeners with the ``version_info`` of their last","+change, except that a change of only the filter chains of an active listener can keep the previous","+version. When Envoy fails to create the listener of a write, the config dump shows the error until a","+later write of the listener succeeds, the module removes the listener, or an LDS update arrives.","+Envoy does not time out a write that never finishes warming, so a module that waits for its writes","+to become active should bound that wait itself.","+","+The listener writer emits the following statistics with the ``dynamic_modules.listener_writer.``","+prefix, tagged with ``config_name`` set to the extension name, or ``default`` if it is empty.","+","+.. csv-table::","+  :header: Name, Type, Description","+  :widths: 1, 1, 2","+","+  update_submitted, Counter, Writes that Envoy accepted","+  update_rejected, Counter, Writes that Envoy refused before the server was initialized or after shutdown began","+  update_active, Counter, Writes that became active","+  update_superseded, Counter, Writes that a later write replaced before they became active","+  update_removed, Counter, Writes that a removal ended before they became active","+  update_failed, Counter, Writes that failed when Envoy applied them or whose listener failed to listen","+  update_ownership_lost, Counter, Writes that ended because another component replaced or removed the listener","+  ownership_lost, Counter, Listeners that another component replaced or removed","+  listeners_owned, Gauge, Listeners that the module owns","+  updates_pending, Gauge, Writes that are queued or warming or that wait for the workers to start","+"," Use Cases"," ---------"," "],"additions":59,"deletions":4,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/BUILD","lines":["@@ -28,6 +28,27 @@ envoy_cc_library(","     ],"," )"," ","+envoy_cc_library(","+    name = \"listener_writer_lib\",","+    srcs = [\"listener_writer.cc\"],","+    hdrs = [\"listener_writer.h\"],","+    deps = [","+        \":resource_writer_lib\",","+        \"//envoy/event:schedulable_cb_interface\",","+        \"//envoy/init:manager_interface\",","+        \"//envoy/server:factory_context_interface\",","+        \"//envoy/server:listener_manager_interface\",","+        \"//source/common/common:fmt_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/config:resource_name_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/init:target_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/protobuf:utility_lib\",","+        \"//source/extensions/dynamic_modules/abi\",","+        \"@abseil-cpp//absl/status\",","+        \"@abseil-cpp//absl/strings\",","+        \"@envoy_api//envoy/config/listener/v3:pkg_cc_proto\",","+    ],","+)","+"," envoy_cc_library(","     name = \"resource_writer_lib\",","     srcs = [\"resource_writer.cc\"],","@@ -66,6 +87,7 @@ envoy_cc_library(","         \"//envoy/singleton:instance_interface\",","         \"//envoy/singleton:manager_interface\",","         \"//source/common/config:dependent_type_urls_lib\",","+        \"@abseil-cpp//absl/container:flat_hash_map\",","         \"@abseil-cpp//absl/container:flat_hash_set\",","         \"@abseil-cpp//absl/strings\",","     ],","@@ -77,6 +99,7 @@ envoy_cc_library(","     hdrs = [\"extension_config.h\"],","     deps = [","         \":cluster_writer_lib\",","+        \":listener_writer_lib\",","         \"//envoy/common:optref_lib\",","         \"//envoy/event:dispatcher_interface\",","         \"//envoy/http:async_client_interface\","],"additions":23,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/abi_impl.cc","lines":["@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@ using Envoy::Extensions::Bootstrap::DynamicModules::DynamicModuleBootstrapExtens"," using Envoy::Extensions::Bootstrap::DynamicModules::DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfigScheduler;"," using Envoy::Extensions::Bootstrap::DynamicModules::DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionTimer;"," using Envoy::Extensions::Bootstrap::DynamicModules::DynamicModuleClusterWriter;","+using Envoy::Extensions::Bootstrap::DynamicModules::DynamicModuleListenerWriter;"," using Envoy::Extensions::DynamicModules::MetricRegistry;"," "," namespace {","@@ -820,4 +821,53 @@ envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_cluster_writer_remove(","   return cluster_writer->removeCluster({cluster_name.ptr, cluster_name.length});"," }"," ","+// -------------------- Listener Writer Callbacks --------------------","+","+bool envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_enable_listener_writer(","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_envoy_ptr extension_config_envoy_ptr) {","+  if (!Envoy::Thread::MainThread::isMainOrTestThread()) {","+    IS_ENVOY_BUG(absl::StrCat(__func__, \" must be called on the main thread\"));","+    return false;","+  }","+  auto* config = static_cast<DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig*>(extension_config_envoy_ptr);","+  return config->enableListenerWriter();","+}","+","+envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_listener_writer_update_result","+envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_add_or_update(","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_envoy_ptr extension_config_envoy_ptr,","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_module_buffer listener_name,","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_module_buffer listener,","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_module_buffer version_info, uint64_t* update_id_out) {","+  *update_id_out = 0;","+  if (!Envoy::Thread::MainThread::isMainOrTestThread()) {","+    IS_ENVOY_BUG(absl::StrCat(__func__, \" must be called on the main thread\"));","+    return envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_listener_writer_update_result_NotAllowed;","+  }","+  auto* config = static_cast<DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig*>(extension_config_envoy_ptr);","+  DynamicModuleListenerWriter* listener_writer = config->listener_writer_.get();","+  if (listener_writer == nullptr) {","+    return envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_listener_writer_update_result_NotAllowed;","+  }","+  return listener_writer->addOrUpdateListener(","+      {listener_name.ptr, listener_name.length}, {listener.ptr, listener.length},","+      {version_info.ptr, version_info.length}, *update_id_out);","+}","+","+envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_listener_writer_removal_result","+envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_remove(","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_envoy_ptr extension_config_envoy_ptr,","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_module_buffer listener_name) {","+  if (!Envoy::Thread::MainThread::isMainOrTestThread()) {","+    IS_ENVOY_BUG(absl::StrCat(__func__, \" must be called on the main thread\"));","+    return envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_listener_writer_removal_result_NotAllowed;","+  }","+  auto* config = static_cast<DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig*>(extension_config_envoy_ptr);","+  DynamicModuleListenerWriter* listener_writer = config->listener_writer_.get();","+  if (listener_writer == nullptr) {","+    return envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_listener_writer_removal_result_NotAllowed;","+  }","+  return listener_writer->removeListener({listener_name.ptr, listener_name.length});","+}","+"," } // extern \"C\""],"additions":50,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/extension.cc","lines":["@@ -85,6 +85,8 @@ void DynamicModuleBootstrapExtension::registerLifecycleCallbacks() {","   // the server's callback lists, so this extension holds the registration.","   config_shutdown_handle_ = config_->context_.lifecycleNotifier().registerCallback(","       Server::ServerLifecycleNotifier::Stage::ShutdownExit, [this]() { config_->onShutdown(); });","+  post_init_handle_ = config_->context_.lifecycleNotifier().registerCallback(","+      Server::ServerLifecycleNotifier::Stage::PostInit, [this]() { config_->onPostInit(); });"," }"," "," } // namespace DynamicModules"],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/extension.h","lines":["@@ -80,6 +80,9 @@ class DynamicModuleBootstrapExtension : public Server::BootstrapExtension,"," ","   // Handle for the shutdown lifecycle callback that notifies the configuration of shutdown.","   Server::ServerLifecycleNotifier::HandlePtr config_shutdown_handle_;","+","+  // Handle for the lifecycle callback that notifies the configuration before the workers start.","+  Server::ServerLifecycleNotifier::HandlePtr post_init_handle_;"," };"," "," } // namespace DynamicModules"],"additions":3,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/extension_config.cc","lines":["@@ -53,6 +53,10 @@ void DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::signalInitComplete() {","   init_target_->ready();","   ENVOY_LOG(debug, \"dynamic modules: init target signaled complete, Envoy may start accepting \"","                    \"traffic\");","+  init_complete_signaled_ = true;","+  if (listener_writer_ != nullptr) {","+    listener_writer_->onModuleInitialized();","+  }"," }"," "," void DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::postSignalInitComplete() {","@@ -285,11 +289,46 @@ bool DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::enableClusterWriter() {","   return true;"," }"," ","+bool DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::enableListenerWriter() {","+  if (listener_writer_ != nullptr || shutdown_started_) {","+    return false;","+  }","+  DynamicModuleListenerWriter::UpdateDoneCallback update_done;","+  if (on_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_update_done_ != nullptr) {","+    update_done = [this](uint64_t update_id, absl::string_view listener_name,","+                         envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_listener_writer_update_status status,","+                         absl::string_view error_details) {","+      on_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_update_done_(","+          thisAsVoidPtr(), in_module_config_, update_id,","+          {listener_name.data(), listener_name.size()}, status,","+          {error_details.data(), error_details.size()});","+    };","+  }","+  listener_writer_ = std::make_unique<DynamicModuleListenerWriter>(extension_name_, context_,","+                                                                   std::move(update_done));","+  if (listener_manager_ != nullptr) {","+    listener_writer_->onServerInitialized(*listener_manager_);","+  }","+  if (init_complete_signaled_) {","+    listener_writer_->onModuleInitialized();","+  }","+  return true;","+}","+","+void DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::onPostInit() {","+  if (listener_writer_ != nullptr) {","+    listener_writer_->onPostInit();","+  }","+}","+"," void DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::onShutdown() {","   shutdown_started_ = true;","   if (cluster_writer_ != nullptr) {","     cluster_writer_->onShutdown();","   }","+  if (listener_writer_ != nullptr) {","+    listener_writer_->onShutdown();","+  }"," }"," "," void DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::onExtensionDestroyed() {","@@ -556,8 +595,8 @@ newDynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig(","       extension_name, extension_config, metrics_namespace, std::move(dynamic_module),","       main_thread_dispatcher, context, stats_store);"," ","-  // The module constructor can enable the cluster writer, which captures its done hook, so the","-  // optional hooks are resolved first.","+  // The module constructor can enable the writers, which capture their done hooks, so the optional","+  // hooks are resolved first.","   auto on_worker_event =","       config->dynamic_module_->getFunctionPointer<OnBootstrapExtensionWorkerEventType>(","           \"envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_worker_event\");","@@ -573,6 +612,11 @@ newDynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig(","           \"envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_cluster_writer_update_done\");","   config->on_bootstrap_extension_cluster_writer_update_done_ =","       on_cluster_writer_update_done.ok() ? on_cluster_writer_update_done.value() : nullptr;","+  auto on_listener_writer_update_done =","+      config->dynamic_module_->getFunctionPointer<OnBootstrapExtensionListenerWriterUpdateDoneType>(","+          \"envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_update_done\");","+  config->on_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_update_done_ =","+      on_listener_writer_update_done.ok() ? on_listener_writer_update_done.value() : nullptr;"," ","   // Always register an init target so that Envoy blocks traffic until the module signals readiness.","   // This must happen before calling the module constructor so the module can call"],"additions":46,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/extension_config.h","lines":["@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@"," #include \"source/common/http/message_impl.h\""," #include \"source/common/init/target_impl.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/cluster_writer.h\"","+#include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/listener_writer.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/dynamic_modules/abi/abi.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/dynamic_modules/dynamic_modules.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/dynamic_modules/metric_registry.h\"","@@ -71,6 +72,8 @@ using OnBootstrapExtensionRunOnAllWorkersDoneType =","     decltype(&envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_run_on_all_workers_done);"," using OnBootstrapExtensionClusterWriterUpdateDoneType =","     decltype(&envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_cluster_writer_update_done);","+using OnBootstrapExtensionListenerWriterUpdateDoneType =","+    decltype(&envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_update_done);"," "," class DynamicModuleBootstrapExtension;"," ","@@ -161,7 +164,7 @@ class DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig","   /**","    * Sets the listener manager reference. Must be called during onServerInitialized before","    * the module can enable listener lifecycle events. Marks the server as initialized so the","-   * cluster manager can be accessed safely and the cluster writer accepts writes.","+   * cluster manager can be accessed safely and the writers accept writes.","    */","   void setListenerManager(Server::ListenerManager& listener_manager) {","     listener_manager_ = &listener_manager;","@@ -169,6 +172,9 @@ class DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig","     if (cluster_writer_ != nullptr) {","       cluster_writer_->onServerInitialized();","     }","+    if (listener_writer_ != nullptr) {","+      listener_writer_->onServerInitialized(listener_manager);","+    }","   }"," ","   /**","@@ -223,6 +229,19 @@ class DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig","    */","   bool enableClusterWriter();"," ","+  /**","+   * Creates the listener writer, which lets the module add, update and remove listeners. Must be","+   * called on the main thread.","+   * @return false if the listener writer already exists or shutdown began.","+   */","+  bool enableListenerWriter();","+","+  /**","+   * Called on the main thread once Envoy finished initializing, right before it starts its","+   * workers.","+   */","+  void onPostInit();","+","   /**","    * Called on the main thread when the server begins to shut down and when the extension is","    * destroyed.","@@ -272,6 +291,8 @@ class DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig","       nullptr;","   OnBootstrapExtensionClusterWriterUpdateDoneType","       on_bootstrap_extension_cluster_writer_update_done_ = nullptr;","+  OnBootstrapExtensionListenerWriterUpdateDoneType","+      on_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_update_done_ = nullptr;"," ","   // The name of the extension.","   const std::string extension_name_;","@@ -320,6 +341,8 @@ class DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig"," ","   // The cluster writer, or nullptr until the module enables it.","   DynamicModuleClusterWriterPtr cluster_writer_;","+  // The listener writer, or nullptr until the module enables it.","+  DynamicModuleListenerWriterPtr listener_writer_;"," "," private:","   /**","@@ -389,6 +412,9 @@ class DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig","   // Thread-local slot that carries the worker events. Allocated on the first runOnAllWorkers().","   ThreadLocal::TypedSlotPtr<> worker_slot_;"," ","+  // Set once the module signals that its initialization is complete.","+  bool init_complete_signaled_ = false;","+","   // Set once the server begins to shut down or the extension is destroyed.","   bool shutdown_started_ = false;","   // Set when the extension is destroyed, after which context_ can be gone."],"additions":27,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/listener_writer.cc","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,372 @@","+#include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/listener_writer.h\"","+","+#include <chrono>","+#include <utility>","+","+#include \"envoy/config/listener/v3/listener.pb.validate.h\"","+#include \"envoy/init/manager.h\"","+","+#include \"source/common/common/fmt.h\"","+#include \"source/common/config/resource_name.h\"","+#include \"source/common/protobuf/utility.h\"","+","+#include \"absl/strings/str_cat.h\"","+","+namespace Envoy {","+namespace Extensions {","+namespace Bootstrap {","+namespace DynamicModules {","+","+static_assert(static_cast<int>(WriteOutcome::Active) ==","+              envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_listener_writer_update_status_Active);","+static_assert(static_cast<int>(WriteOutcome::Superseded) ==","+              envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_listener_writer_update_status_Superseded);","+static_assert(static_cast<int>(WriteOutcome::Removed) ==","+              envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_listener_writer_update_status_Removed);","+static_assert(static_cast<int>(WriteOutcome::Failed) ==","+              envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_listener_writer_update_status_Failed);","+static_assert(static_cast<int>(WriteOutcome::OwnershipLost) ==","+              envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_listener_writer_update_status_OwnershipLost);","+static_assert(static_cast<int>(RemovalResult::Success) ==","+              envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_listener_writer_removal_result_Success);","+static_assert(static_cast<int>(RemovalResult::NotAllowed) ==","+              envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_listener_writer_removal_result_NotAllowed);","+static_assert(static_cast<int>(RemovalResult::NotFound) ==","+              envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_listener_writer_removal_result_NotFound);","+","+namespace {","+","+// The status of a listen failure does not say whether Envoy removed the listener.","+std::string listenFailureDetails(absl::string_view listener_name, bool removed) {","+  return removed ? fmt::format(\"listener {} failed to listen and was removed\", listener_name)","+                 : fmt::format(\"listener {} failed to listen and its active version keeps serving\",","+                               listener_name);","+}","+","+} // namespace","+","+DynamicModuleListenerWriter::DynamicModuleListenerWriter(","+    absl::string_view extension_name, Server::Configuration::ServerFactoryContext& context,","+    UpdateDoneCallback update_done)","+    : ResourceWriter(extension_name, context, std::move(update_done),","+                     {\"listener_writer\", \"listeners_owned\"},","+                     Config::getTypeUrl<envoy::config::listener::v3::Listener>()),","+      init_target_(absl::StrCat(\"dynamic_modules_bootstrap_listener_writer:\", config_name_),","+                   [this]() { onClustersInitialized(); }),","+      workers_started_callback_(context.mainThreadDispatcher().createSchedulableCallback(","+          [this]() { onWorkersStarted(); })),","+      init_target_check_callback_(context.mainThreadDispatcher().createSchedulableCallback(","+          [this]() { maybeSignalInitTargetReady(); })) {}","+","+void DynamicModuleListenerWriter::onServerInitialized(Server::ListenerManager& listener_manager) {","+  listener_manager_ = &listener_manager;","+  server_initialized_ = true;","+  // The server init manager starts once Envoy initialized its clusters, and its targets hold back","+  // the workers, as the initial LDS response does.","+  if (context_.initManager().state() != Init::Manager::State::Initialized) {","+    context_.initManager().add(init_target_);","+  } else {","+    onClustersInitialized();","+  }","+}","+","+void DynamicModuleListenerWriter::onClustersInitialized() {","+  // Only a running server starts its init manager, and it calls onShutdown() before it frees the","+  // listener manager.","+  if (!shut_down_) {","+    listener_update_callbacks_handle_ = listener_manager_->addListenerUpdateCallbacks(*this);","+  }","+  startApplying();","+  maybeSignalInitTargetReady();","+}","+","+void DynamicModuleListenerWriter::onModuleInitialized() {","+  if (!init_cutoff_.has_value()) {","+    init_cutoff_ = nextSequence();","+  }","+  maybeSignalInitTargetReady();","+}","+","+void DynamicModuleListenerWriter::maybeSignalInitTargetReady() {","+  const std::optional<uint64_t> earliest_queued_sequence = earliestQueuedSequence();","+  if (clustersInitialized() && init_cutoff_.has_value() &&","+      (!earliest_queued_sequence.has_value() || *earliest_queued_sequence >= *init_cutoff_)) {","+    init_target_.ready();","+  }","+}","+","+void DynamicModuleListenerWriter::onPostInit() {","+  if (!shut_down_) {","+    workers_started_callback_->scheduleCallbackNextIteration();","+  }","+}","+","+void DynamicModuleListenerWriter::onWorkersStarted() {","+  for (auto& [listener_name, state] : states_) {","+    if (state.waits_for_workers) {","+      state.waits_for_workers = false;","+      completeWarmingUpdate(listener_name, state, WriteOutcome::Active);","+    }","+  }","+}","+","+void DynamicModuleListenerWriter::onShutdown() {","+  // The listener manager goes away before this writer does.","+  listener_update_callbacks_handle_.reset();","+  workers_started_callback_->cancel();","+  init_target_check_callback_->cancel();","+  shutDown();","+}","+","+envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_listener_writer_update_result","+DynamicModuleListenerWriter::addOrUpdateListener(absl::string_view listener_name,","+                                                 absl::string_view listener,","+                                                 absl::string_view version_info,","+                                     